/Subject (This\040paper\040proposes\040a\040framework\040of\040waveform\040relaxation\040methods\040to\040simulate\040electromagnetic\040fields\040coupled\040to\040electric\040networks\056\040Within\040this\040framework\054\040a\040guarantee\040for\040convergence\040and\040stability\040of\040Gaus\055Seidel\055type\040methods\040is\040found\040by\040partial\040differential\040algebraic\040equation\040\050PDAE\051\040analysis\056\040It\040is\040shown\040that\040different\040time\040step\040sizes\040in\040different\040parts\040of\040the\040model\040can\040be\040automatically\040chosen\040according\040to\040the\040problem\047s\040dynamics\056\040A\040finite\055element\040model\040of\040a\040transformer\040coupled\040to\040a\040circuit\040illustrates\040the\040efficiency\040of\040multirate\040methods\056)
